{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_44288","headline":"从萧叔子听弹琴赋得三峡流泉歌 · 李冶","name":"从萧叔子听弹琴赋得三峡流泉歌","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"妾家本住巫山云，巫山流泉常自闻。\n玉琴弹出转寥敻，直是当时梦里听。\n三峡迢迢几千里，一时流入幽闺里。\n巨石崩崖指下生，飞泉走浪弦中起。\n初疑愤怒含雷风，又似呜咽流不通。\n回湍曲濑势将尽，时复滴沥平沙中。\n忆昔阮公爲此曲，能令仲容听不足。\n一弹既罢复一弹，愿作流泉镇相续。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"李冶","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_44288.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_44288","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}